 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Tsarine Champagne Reims dekoratív hordozható pezsgőhűtő.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Különleges színek.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Feltűnő ajándék champagne szerető ismerőseinknek.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A pezsgős jégveder kitűnő karcmentes vintage állapotban van.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-c17b62fd045a4b2d7075162e4fdc4387\"><strong>Leather-lined pink TSARINE Champagne portable champagne bucket</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tsarine Champagne Reims decorative portable champagne bucket.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Special colors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A striking gift for our champagne-loving friends.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The champagne ice bucket is in excellent scratch-free vintage condition.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Itt talál további <strong>Francia Champagne pezsgőhűtő jégvedreket</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://champagneclub.hu/category/pezsgos-jeges-vodrok/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/champagneclub.hu/\"></a></figure>\n",
